    "description": "What: rules S1 (DESIGN_Scenario_Rules 00.8) - the ua-squad-march-loose squad marches ~110 m east to the crossroads at (175,60) on test-town, no enemy, judged by four Objective entities (TKB 8860) under a WeightedMean 'Squad mission' (pass 0.5). Judge: 'Reach the crossroads' (4 men within 15 m, deadline 300 s) ends Achieved; 'Hold the crossroads' (required, 4 men for 20 s) ends Achieved after it; 'Reach the far line' (circle at (400,400), deadline 60 s) ends Failed at 60 s; 'No harm to civilians' stays Active with Score 1 (judged at the end); the root stays Active (a constraint is not final) with Score 0.75 once the far line has failed. GET /objectives shows the tree under the root. Fail: a status stays Pending, the far line is Achieved, the root is Failed, or /objectives lists no tree. Check: GET /objectives"
